# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, and check out LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, editing on Windows rewrites whole files to CRLF and git reports
# every line as changed - the LICENSE showed a 21-insertion, 21-deletion diff
# whose content was byte-identical. That noise hides real changes in review.
#
# LF also matches Prettier's default, so `npm run format` and git agree.
#
# After adding this file, run once to rewrite the index:
#   git add --renormalize .
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these, whatever they contain.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb binary
*.ktx2 binary
